##### Rule Meaning
Using type casting can make code difficult to understand and maintain, especially when dealing with complex expressions. By using explicit boolean comparisons, code readability and maintainability can be improved.

##### Error Example
'''php
$value = 0;
if ((bool) $value) {
    echo 'True';
} else {
    echo 'False';
}
'''

