}

class MySubClass extends MyClass {
    const SOME_CONSTANT = 'new value'; // Overriding class constant
}
```

##### Correct Example
```php
class MyClass {
    final const SOME_CONSTANT = 'value';
}

class MySubClass extends MyClass {
    // Cannot override SOME_CONSTANT, ensuring its safety
}
```

