此规则旨在确保类常量定义中包含原生类型提示，以提升代码的可读性和可维护性。

##### 规则意义
在PHP中，类型提示可以提高代码质量，减少运行时错误。在类常量声明时，缺少原生类型可能导致团队成员对常量用途的误解，增加理解和使用的难度。

##### 错误示例
'''php
class SampleClass {
    const MY_CONST = 'Hello';
    const MY_NUMBER = 42;
}
'''  

##### 正确示例
'''php
class SampleClass {
    const MY_CONST: string = 'Hello';
    const MY_NUMBER: int = 42;
}
'''

rules.content_en:
#### Rule Overview
This rule aims to ensure that native type hints are included in class constant definitions to enhance code readability and maintainability.

##### Rule Significance
In PHP, type hints can improve code quality and reduce runtime errors. The absence of native types in class constant declarations may lead to misunderstandings among team members regarding the purpose of constants, increasing difficulties in understanding and usage.

##### Error Example
'''php
class SampleClass {
    const MY_CONST = 'Hello';
    const MY_NUMBER = 42;
}
'''  

##### Correct Example
'''php
class SampleClass {
    const MY_CONST: string = 'Hello';
    const MY_NUMBER: int = 42;
}
'''

rules.content:
#### 规则概述
此规则检查 PHP 类中的常量是否为最终化的，以确保常量值在类的生命周期内不会被重写。

##### 规则意义
定义为 final 的常量可以提高代码的可预测性和稳定性，防止在继承类中意外地修改常量值。

##### 错误示例
'''php
class MyClass {
    const MY_CONSTANT = 'value'; // 非最终化常量
}

class MyChildClass extends MyClass {
    const MY_CONSTANT = 'new_value'; // 重写了父类常量
}
'''

##### 正确示例
'''php
class MyClass {
    final const MY_CONSTANT = 'value'; // 最终化常量
}

class MyChildClass extends MyClass {
    // 不能重写 MY_CONSTANT，确保其值不变
}
'''

rules.content_en:
#### Rule Overview
This rule checks if constants in a PHP class are final, ensuring that constant values are not overwritten during the class's lifecycle.

##### Rule Significance
Defining constants as final enhances the predictability and stability of the code, preventing accidental modification of constant values in derived classes.

##### Error Example
'''php
class MyClass {
    const MY_CONSTANT = 'value'; // Non-final constant
}

class MyChildClass extends MyClass {
    const MY_CONSTANT = 'new_value'; // Overriding the parent class constant
}
'''

##### Correct Example
'''php
class MyClass {
    final const MY_CONSTANT = 'value'; // Final constant
}

class MyChildClass extends MyClass {
    // Cannot override MY_CONSTANT, ensuring its value remains unchanged
}
'''

rules.content:
#### 规则概述
类常量应当用于定义基本数据类型或对象类型，非对象类型的类常量可能导致代码可读性下降或引入不必要的复杂性。

##### 规则意义
此规则针对那些将类常量定义为非对象类型的情况进行检测。使用非对象类型的常量可能使得代码在扩展或维护时出现问题，同时也不符合面向对象的编程理念。

