rules.content:
#### 规则概述
该规则提醒开发者避免在Trait中定义类常量。

##### 规则意义
在PHP中，Trait是用于代码复用的机制，而类常量的定义则是特定于类的。将类常量放在Trait中可能导致代码的可读性和维护性下降，并可能产生意外的行为。在Trait中，类常量并不是策略模式的正确实现。

##### 错误示例
'''php
trait MyTrait {
    const MY_CONSTANT = 'value'; // 不推荐在Trait中定义类常量
}

class MyClass {
    use MyTrait;
}
'''

##### 正确示例
'''php
trait MyTrait {
    // Trait中不定义常量
}

class MyClass {
    const MY_CONSTANT = 'value'; // 将常量放在类中定义是更好的做法
    use MyTrait;
}
'''

rules.content_en:
#### Rule Overview
This rule advises developers to avoid defining class constants in Traits.

##### Rule Meaning
In PHP, Traits are a mechanism for code reuse, while the definition of class constants is specific to classes. Putting class constants in a Trait may lead to decreased readability and maintainability of the code, and could result in unexpected behavior. Class constants in a Trait are not the correct implementation of the strategy pattern.

##### Incorrect Example
'''php
trait MyTrait {
    const MY_CONSTANT = 'value'; // Defining class constants in a Trait is not recommended
}

class MyClass {
    use MyTrait;
}
'''

##### Correct Example
'''php
trait MyTrait {
    // Do not define constants in Traits
}

class MyClass {
    const MY_CONSTANT = 'value'; // It's a better practice to define constants in the class
    use MyTrait;
}
'''

rules.content:
