rules.content:
#### 规则概述
此规则检查枚举类中是否允许动态属性的定义。

##### 规则意义
在PHP中，枚举类应当是一个固定的、不允许改变的类型。如果枚举类允许动态添加属性，可能导致代码不易维护和理解。

##### 错误示例
'''php
enum Color {
    case RED;
    case GREEN;
}

$color = Color::RED;
$color->blue = true; // 动态添加属性，错误示例
'''

##### 正确示例
'''php
enum Color {
    case RED;
    case GREEN;
}

$color = Color::RED;
// $color->blue = true; // 不应动态添加属性
'''

rules.content_en:
#### Rule Overview
This rule checks whether the definition of dynamic properties is allowed in enumeration classes.

##### Rule Meaning
In PHP, enumeration classes should be a fixed and immutable type. If an enumeration class allows dynamic properties to be added, it may lead to code that is difficult to maintain and understand.

##### Incorrect Example
'''php
enum Color {
    case RED;
    case GREEN;
}

$color = Color::RED;
$color->blue = true; // Dynamically adding a property, incorrect example
'''

##### Correct Example
'''php
enum Color {
    case RED;
    case GREEN;
}

$color = Color::RED;
// $color->blue = true; // Dynamic property addition should not occur
'''

rules.content:
#### 规则概述
此规则要求所有 PHP 的枚举类型必须明确指定其后备类型，确保代码的一致性和可读性。

##### 规则意义
在 PHP 中，枚举（Enum）是一种特殊类型的类，表示一组可选值。明确设置枚举的后备类型（如 `int` 或 `string`），能够帮助开发者更好地理解枚举所代表的值的类型，有助于减少类型错误。

##### 错误示例
'''php
enum Status {
    case ACTIVE;
    case INACTIVE;
}
'''

##### 正确示例
'''php
enum Status: string {
    case ACTIVE = 'active';
    case INACTIVE = 'inactive';
}
'''

rules.content_en:
#### Rule Overview
This rule requires all PHP enumeration types to explicitly specify their backing type, ensuring code consistency and readability.

##### Rule Significance
In PHP, an enum is a special type of class that represents a set of optional values. Explicitly setting the backing type of an enum (such as `int` or `string`) helps developers better understand the types of the values represented by the enum, which aids in reducing type errors.

##### Error Example
'''php
enum Status {
    case ACTIVE;
    case INACTIVE;
}
'''

##### Correct Example
'''php
enum Status: string {
    case ACTIVE = 'active';
    case INACTIVE = 'inactive';
}
'''

rules.content:
