rules.content_en:
#### Rule Overview
This rule checks for improper situations when defining and using PHP enumerations.

##### Rule Significance
Ensuring the accurate use of enumerations can enhance code readability and maintainability, while avoiding the introduction of potential errors.

##### Error Example
'''php
enum Status {
    case PENDING;
    case COMPLETED;
