#### 规则概述
在类的子类中，如果重写了一个父类中的方法，并且这个方法的参数列表或方法名与父类中的方法相同，那么这个子类的方法将会覆盖掉父类的方法，导致潜在的错误和难以追踪的问题。

##### 规则意义
此规则旨在提醒开发者注意方法的覆盖问题，以避免意外地隐藏了父类的方法。这样做可以提高代码的可读性和可维护性，同时防止潜在的缺陷和逻辑错误。

##### 错误示例
```php
class ParentClass {
    public function display($message) {
        echo $message;
    }
}

class ChildClass extends ParentClass {
    public function display($newMessage) {
        echo $newMessage;
    }
}
```

##### 正确示例
```php
class ParentClass {
    public function display($message) {
        echo $message;
    }
}

class ChildClass extends ParentClass {
    public function displayWithPrefix($prefix, $message) {
        echo $prefix . ' ' . $message;
    }
}
```

rules.content_en:
#### Rule Overview
In a subclass of a class, if a method from the parent class is overridden and the parameter list or method name is the same as that in the parent class, then the subclass's method will override the parent's method, leading to potential errors and hard-to-trace issues.

##### Rule Significance
The purpose of this rule is to remind developers to be aware of method overriding issues, to avoid unintentionally hiding the parent's method. Doing so can improve the readability and maintainability of the code while preventing potential defects and logical errors.

##### Incorrect Example
```php
class ParentClass {
    public function display($message) {
        echo $message;
    }
}

class ChildClass extends ParentClass {
    public function display($newMessage) {
        echo $newMessage;
    }
}
```

##### Correct Example
```php
class ParentClass {
    public function display($message) {
        echo $message;
    }
}

class ChildClass extends ParentClass {
    public function displayWithPrefix($prefix, $message) {
        echo $prefix . ' ' . $message;
    }
}
```

