rules.content_en:
#### Rule Overview
Comparing operations where the left-side value is not a number may lead to incorrect comparison results.

##### Rule Significance
Ensure that the left-side comparison value is a number to avoid logical errors caused by type mismatches.

##### Incorrect Example
'''php
if ('a' < 10) {
    // This line of code is logically incorrect because 'a' is not a number
}
'''

