rules.content:
#### 规则概述
此规则旨在防止开发者直接实例化没有定义构造函数的类，以提高代码的可维护性和可扩展性。

##### 规则意义
如果一个类没有构造函数，将失去对对象初始化过程的控制能力，可能导致后续开发中出现不可预知的行为，降低代码的安全性和可维护性。

##### 错误示例
'''php
class User {
    public $name;
}

$user = new User(); // 错误：直接实例化没有构造函数的类
'''

##### 正确示例
'''php
class User {
    public $name;

    public function __construct($name) {
        $this->name = $name;
    }
}

$user = new User('John Doe'); // 正确：使用构造函数进行初始化
'''

rules.content_en:
#### Rule Overview
This rule aims to prevent developers from directly instantiating classes without a defined constructor, to improve code maintainability and extensibility.

##### Rule Significance
If a class lacks a constructor, it loses control over the object initialization process, which may lead to unpredictable behavior in subsequent development, reducing code safety and maintainability.

##### Incorrect Example
'''php
class User {
    public $name;
}

$user = new User(); // Error: Directly instantiating a class without a constructor
'''

##### Correct Example
'''php
class User {
    public $name;

    public function __construct($name) {
        $this->name = $name;
    }
}

$user = new User('John Doe'); // Correct: Using a constructor for initialization
'''

rules.content:
#### 规则概述
