#### 规则概述
这个规则检查在定义一个类时，它所实施的接口是否被完全实现。

##### 规则意义
未实现接口中的所有方法可能导致不一致行为和可维护性差。确保类实现其所有接口，可以提高代码的可预测性和可维护性。

##### 错误示例
'''php
interface UserInterface {
    public function getName();
    public function getEmail();
}

class User implements UserInterface {
    public function getName() {
        return 'John';
    }
    // getEmail 方法未实现
}
'''

##### 正确示例
'''php
interface UserInterface {
    public function getName();
    public function getEmail();
}

class User implements UserInterface {
    public function getName() {
        return 'John';
    }

    public function getEmail() {
        return 'john@example.com';
    }
}
'''

rules.content_en:
#### Rule Overview
This rule checks whether all the interfaces implemented by a class are fully realized.

##### Rule Meaning
Not implementing all methods in an interface can lead to inconsistent behavior and poor maintainability. Ensuring that a class implements all its interfaces can improve the predictability and maintainability of the code.

##### Error Example
'''php
interface UserInterface {
    public function getName();
    public function getEmail();
}

class User implements UserInterface {
    public function getName() {
        return 'John';
    }
    // getEmail method is not implemented
}
'''

##### Correct Example
'''php
interface UserInterface {
    public function getName();
    public function getEmail();
}

class User implements UserInterface {
    public function getName() {
        return 'John';
    }

    public function getEmail() {
        return 'john@example.com';
    }
}
'''

