```php
class MyClass {
    private $value;

    public function __construct($value) {
        $this->value = $value;
    }

    public function getValue() {
        return $this->value; // 通过公共方法访问
    }
}

class StaticClass {
    public static function getValue() {
        return (new MyClass(10))->getValue(); // 通过公共方法调用
    }
}
```

rules.content_en:
#### Rule Overview
Accessing private properties of a class in a static context is not allowed. This practice can lead to decreased maintainability and readability of the code.

