    public static $counter = 0; // 错误：静态属性不应为非对象类型
}
```

##### 正确示例
```php
class Counter {
    private $count;

    public function __construct() {
        $this->count = 0;
    }
}

class Example {
    public static $instance; // 正确：使用对象类型

    public static function init() {
        self::$instance = new Counter();
    }
}
```

