rules.content:
#### 规则概述
本规则检查PHP中的Trait是否正确定义了变量标签。

##### 规则意义
Trait是一种重用代码的机制，它允许在多个类之间共享方法和属性。如果在Trait中使用变量而没有适当的标签，会导致代码的可读性下降和潜在的类型错误。

##### 错误示例
'''php
trait MyTrait {
    /** @var int */
    private $count;

    public function increment() {
        $this->count++;
    }
}

class MyClass {
    use MyTrait;
}
'''

##### 正确示例
'''php
trait MyTrait {
    /** @var int */
    private $count;

    public function increment() : void {
        $this->count++;
    }
}

class MyClass {
    use MyTrait;
}
'''

注意：在Trait中定义变量时，应该使用适当的PHPDoc标签来指明变量的类型。

rules.content_en:
#### Rule Overview
This rule checks whether variables in a Trait in PHP are correctly defined with appropriate type annotations.

##### Rule Significance
A Trait is a mechanism for code reuse that allows methods and properties to be shared across multiple classes. If variables are used in a Trait without appropriate annotations, it may lead to decreased code readability and potential type errors.

##### Incorrect Example
'''php
trait MyTrait {
    /** @var int */
    private $count;

    public function increment() {
        $this->count++;
    }
}

class MyClass {
    use MyTrait;
}
'''

##### Correct Example
'''php
trait MyTrait {
    /** @var int */
    private $count;

    public function increment() : void {
        $this->count++;
    }
}

class MyClass {
    use MyTrait;
}
'''

Note: When defining variables in a Trait, appropriate PHPDoc tags should be used to indicate the variable type.

